{"id": "EUVD-2026-56902", "enisaUuid": "08dce885-d13e-306b-afe6-56e0db9d3fbe", "description": "A flaw was found in insights-client. When the application receives a non-200 response, it logs the request headers, which can include the cloud.openshift.com pull-secret token. A local user with access to pod logs on the hub could read this long-lived credential. This information disclosure could grant unauthorized access to Red Hat cloud services.", "datePublished": "2026-08-11T19:24:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-05T17:07:52", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:N", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:60386", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:60387", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:60388", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:60389", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:60390", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:60391", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-71474", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2512153"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-71474", "GHSA-6q5x-r3rm-rpv8"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3e9b6f69-13af-3ea6-8211-7bae62e6f815", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management for Kubernetes 2.14", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1786882244"}, {"id": "4ba96ecd-e02a-352a-a304-cc33d7abb8a3", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management for Kubernetes 2.15", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787238585"}, {"id": "4bffb72e-8e77-33c2-9375-067d8b87df1f", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management for Kubernetes 2.17", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787227689"}, {"id": "54d52029-6139-36ca-83ed-5beedb0851a3", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management for Kubernetes 2.16", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 1787184541"}, {"id": "59bf5c75-